{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-15", "prepared_on": "2026-11-15", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-15</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Jensen Huang resigns as Nvidia CEO, CFO Colette Kress named interim CEO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳辭去 Nvidia 執行長，財務長 Colette Kress 接任臨時執行長</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia's board announced on Nov. 12 that Huang resigned as president, CEO and director, effective immediately. Shares fell as much as 10%, pushing market value below $4 trillion, while AMD jumped 27%.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia 董事會 11 月 12 日宣布黃仁勳辭去總裁、執行長與董事職位，立即生效。股價一度重挫 10%、市值跌破 4 兆美元，對手 AMD 則大漲 27%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180472\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Jensen Huang's departure blasts big hole in AI startup funding, VCs and founders say<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳離職讓 AI 新創融資出現大缺口，創投與創辦人預期支票變小、估值走低</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia poured tens of billions into AI startups under Huang. Without him at the helm, founders and VCs are bracing for smaller checks and lower valuations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在黃仁勳領導下，Nvidia 對 AI 新創投入了數百億美元。他離開後，創辦人與創投預期投資金額會縮水，估值也會下降。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/13/jensen-huangs-departure-blasts-big-hole-in-ai-startup-funding-vcs-and-founders-say/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> ChatGPT Wallet lets OpenAI's Dots agents make purchases for you<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">ChatGPT Wallet 讓 OpenAI 的 Dots 代理人能代為購物</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI is rolling out a wallet for its agents, starting with US ChatGPT Pro subscribers aged 18+. Agents in ChatGPT Work, Codex and dots can complete purchases with user approval and existing card protections.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 為旗下代理人推出錢包功能，首批開放給 18 歲以上的美國 ChatGPT Pro 訂閱者。代理人經使用者核准後即可完成購買，並沿用既有信用卡保護機制。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1033425/openai-chatgpt-wallet\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Beware the New AI-Fueled Ransomware Boom<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">小心新一波由 AI 推動的勒索軟體熱潮</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Fully automated ransomware hasn't arrived yet. But seemingly unsophisticated attackers are using AI tools to wreak havoc.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">全自動化的勒索軟體尚未出現，但看似技術不高的攻擊者已開始利用 AI 工具大肆破壞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/beware-the-new-ai-fueled-ransomware-boom/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> OpenAI board member worries an AI \"takeover\" of society could be months away<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 董事擔心 AI 對社會的「接管」可能只剩幾個月</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A researcher traces a path from AI reward hacking to potential human extinction, warning the timeline may be short.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一位研究者描繪出從 AI 獎勵駭客行為（reward hacking）到人類可能滅絕的路徑，並警告時間可能很短。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/11/ai-is-the-most-likely-reason-youll-die-openai-board-member-warns/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Asian governments react to Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang's exit<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">亞洲各國政府對黃仁勳離職的反應</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Some governments moved to confirm chip supply commitments, while others are monitoring the impact on local projects or addressing ongoing investigations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">部分政府急於確認晶片供應承諾，其他則在觀察對當地計畫的影響，或處理進行中的調查。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/14/asian-governments-react-to-nvidia-ceo-jensen-huangs-exit/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Microsoft's global outage may be worse than Amazon's or CrowdStrike's, expert says<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">專家：微軟全球當機恐比亞馬遜或 CrowdStrike 事件更嚴重</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Governments, hospitals and courts were scrambled by the global Microsoft outage. Microsoft blames failed server health checks, not hackers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟全球當機讓各國政府、醫院與法院陷入混亂。微軟表示原因是伺服器健康檢查失敗，而非駭客攻擊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/11/microsoft-blames-failed-server-health-checks-not-hackers-for-global-outage/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Google teams with Samsung on Gemini AI smart glasses to challenge Meta<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 攜三星推出 AI 智慧眼鏡，挑戰市場龍頭 Meta</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google announced Gemini-powered smart glasses with Samsung, Gentle Monster and Warby Parker, launching Dec. 10 first in the US and South Korea, not including Taiwan at first.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 宣布與三星、Gentle Monster、Warby Parker 推出搭載 Gemini 的智慧眼鏡，12 月 10 日先在美國與南韓上市，首波不含臺灣。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180473\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> AWS expands AgentCore runtime for large builds and local model loading<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AWS 擴充 AgentCore 執行環境，支援大型程式編譯與本地模型載入</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Runtime V2 for Amazon Bedrock AgentCore offers up to 8 vCPUs and 32 GB memory per session, with container images up to 10 GB. It is now the default for new environments in 19 AWS regions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 新一代 Runtime V2 單一工作階段最多 8 個 vCPU、32 GB 記憶體，容器映像檔上限提高到 10 GB，目前已是 19 個 AWS 區域新建環境的預設版本。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180503\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Linux Foundation survey: 58% of teams say software ships faster than security can review<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Linux 基金會調查：軟體交付速度超過資安審查能力，近 6 成團隊跟不上</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">In a survey of 308 security professionals, developers and open-source contributors, 58% said delivery speed has outpaced security review capacity amid AI's impact.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">調查訪問 308 名資安人員、開發者與開源貢獻者，58% 表示在 AI 影響下，軟體交付速度已快到安全審查難以跟上。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180398\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}